        "official_en_sha256": "128e08cf009bc44655ef2369909d57fdbb2c746d2000d056c416dcb2fd84aeb9"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "前のものよりテカリが素晴らしい。\r\nなんといってもテカリが大事じゃからな。\r\nこれは最高の甲羅じゃ。",
        "official_en": "It has a beautiful patina; that’s how you know it’s good. I couldn’t dream of a better shell!",
        "real_en": "The shine is even better than the last one's! The shine is what matters most, after all. This is the finest shell I've seen!"
      },
